This repository is not a single-licensed body of work — it mixes someone else's shared scripts with this
repo's own original documentation and bug fixes, and those are covered differently.

## Scripts (`scripts/`)

Everything under `scripts/` is Jonah Coleman's own authored work — classic UCS scripts, and two recovered
AutoIt tools — that he shared publicly on the Hexagon Nexus community forum for other Cabinet Vision users
to use and adapt (see `source-threads/` for the original threads, and README.md's Authorship section for
how authorship is identified where a file carries no explicit credit line). No license is granted here over
that material beyond what he already extended by sharing it publicly for other users to use and build on.
This repo is a version-controlled, bug-fixed copy of what he shared, kept with attribution — it is not a
transfer of his copyright, and nothing here should be read as permission to redistribute, sell, or relicense
his scripts. If you want to use them beyond your own reference/shop use, or you're Jonah Coleman and want
something here changed or removed, please reach out.

## Everything else (this repo's own documentation and bug-fix diffs)

The curated write-ups in `docs/`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `TESTING.md`, and the specific documented
bug-fix diffs applied on top of Jonah Coleman's original scripts (see each script's "What was changed"
notes and `CHANGELOG.md` for exactly what changed and why) are this repo's own original work.

